<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\朝.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\布団電気.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>What kind of dream I had isn't clear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I got into bed, and then it was already morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I had the feeling that a strange noise had disturbed my sleep.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A few seconds after waking, though, what it was became clear.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\パトカー.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A patrol car was running along in high spirits, sounding its siren.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="もときちょう">Motoki-cho</STYLE>, the sound of a patrol car is a rare thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had there been some accident?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Time to get up..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was 30 minutes earlier than when I usually get up, but oddly I was wide awake.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">From early morning the whole area had an unsettled air.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日常.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\居間.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... still asleep, huh."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Neither in the kitchen nor in the living room was there any sign of <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I dropped heavily onto the sofa in the living room and turned on the TV.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Please look! Here in this park in Tohoku the cherry blossoms have begun to open as well, and the forecast is that they will be at their best by next weekend!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed a famous anchorwoman was broadcasting live from a big park.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "1" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cherry blossom news first thing in the morning is the worst.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I changed the channel at once.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yesterday's baseball game was truly a close contest!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　With fierce attack and defense it dragged into extra innings, but―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't really understand sports.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Good morning..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> came shuffling out of her room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Good morning. It's noisy out there this morning somehow..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yeah... it is, isn't it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">,</STYLE> who is supposed to be good in the mornings, looked awfully sleepy.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From somewhere in the living room came a cell phone's ringtone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>'s cell phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah! I've done it again!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> hurried over to the cell phone and picked it up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I forgot to charge it again... It's an old cell phone, so charging it now won't do much anyway... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Oh? </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it's an email from school."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> held the phone screen out to me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ガラケ―赤入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It seemed to be an email from my homeroom teacher.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Subject: School is closed today.</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Body:</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Everyone in Class 2-2, good morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">This is your homeroom teacher, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="むかい">Mukai</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">This morning we received word from the police, and a directive that the students of this school are to be kept at home.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">For this reason, school is closed today. Please do not go out walking about; remain at home.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">If there is any development in the situation, we will post it on the school website.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">That is all.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"So it says. Mind the house for me, all right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So it's an incident after all? It's been noisy since morning, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, now... That's not something for us ordinary folk to comment on."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A whole day of staying home, huh. What'll I do..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"You'll be spending the day with </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">-chan next door, won't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm... but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The truth is, the day before yesterday the DVD of a film I had been looking forward to arrived.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing school was off, I had been thinking of an elegant cinema time by myself, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"She came to visit you yesterday, so go show your face and keep her company. With school suddenly closed she'll have time on her hands, too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come on, come on, don't sit around in a daze, get yourself properly ready to go to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s house."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wouldn't it be a bother if I just barged in... even if it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then you can just invite her over here, can't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> seemed worried about leaving me on my own, given the rather alarming atmosphere this morning.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Right then, mind the house! With</STYLE> <STYLE ID="7">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, get along nicely now!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Just past 8, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> shoveled down the leftovers from yesterday and left for work.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\布団電気.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Maybe I'll try calling </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I went back to my room and picked up my smartphone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The other day it had only just been bought for me as a year-promotion present.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, no, I can see </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> any time, and going out of my way to watch a DVD alone is pretty good too."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
The brand-new smartphone rang, and on the incoming-call screen “<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>” was displayed.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "2" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hello? What's u―"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="4">I forgot to put the trash out! Do it for me instead, please!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Really, and I was going to make it an elegant DVD time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Sorry, sorry! Counting on you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\電話切れる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> said that much and hung up, one-sidedly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
When you get to <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE>'s age, do you turn into this sort of scatterbrained middle-aged woman?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't want the trash left in the house either, so I reluctantly went out of my room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関閉.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ゴミ袋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I went to the entrance, one big trash bag had been left sitting there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To leave something this big sitting there and forget it...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heave-ho<TXSPS>ooooo-up<TXSPN>!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ビニール.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I held the trash bag in both hands and threw the door open with my whole body.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\古郡玄関開.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And then,
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Ow!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same instant as something struck the door, I heard a small scream from a woman.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日曜日の朝.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Oh dear, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">-chan! Good morning, good morning!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed the door I had opened had struck <STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As always, her voice is keyed up right from the morning.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Good morning. Sorry about that, the bag was big so I ended up opening it with a bit of a body slam."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hohoho, it's fiiine!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">-chan, are you taking the trash out too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah. Ah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you are too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"That's riiight! It's been getting warmer, so you have to put the food waste out right awaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I set off with <STYLE ID="8">Auntie</STYLE> for the elevator of the apartment building.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">-chan, how are you feeling? I think our </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> went over to see how you were yesterday."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Thanks for asking, I'm in good shape today!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Ohhh! That's good to heaaar!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that she mentioned it, I noticed that today my body felt remarkably good.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The weather, too, was calm, with no wind at all.<PG>
Even so, I had heard that this <STYLE ID="8">mom of Haruka's</STYLE> was a childhood friend of <STYLE ID="4">my own mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today may be relatively warm, but a sleeveless top with a miniskirt is a combination that shows a lot of skin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is an outfit that even someone my age would hesitate over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's hard to say out loud, but this outfit at this age really does make me wonder.<PG>
I'll grant that she's youthful, beautiful and has a good figure.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I do get the feeling that it is starting to become a stretch.<PG>
Or rather, her way of talking reeks of middle-aged auntie more than <STYLE ID="4">my own mom</STYLE>'s does.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she raises the energy to make a show of youth, but it seems to be backfiring.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How shall I put it...
{PAUSE ""}
Yeah, it's painful...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\エレベーター.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Come to think of it, school's closed today. Was there some kind of incident...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Who can saaay! We ordinary folk wouldn't knoow!"</STYLE>
