<STYLE ID="8"><TXSPD TIME="4294967256">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">-chan! If you don't mind, today, would you keep </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> company? She was saying she's bored with nothing to do now school's closed. And I'm off to work soon. We've got some lovely tea at our plaaace!"</STYLE>
